    "features": "<p><strong>AKA:</strong> Agent, Operative</p><p>Information is one of the most valuable commodities in the system. Governments, corporations, and organizations go through costly measures to obtain data on their allies and enemies, employing those who specialize in obtaining it. Spies have networks of contacts in both government and the criminal underworld. Some follow a code or represent a cause, while others take pride in playing all sides against each other for the highest price.</p><p><strong>Stunts:</strong> Disarm, It Wasn’t Me, Take Cover</p><p><strong>Talents:</strong> Burglary (Expert), Contacts (Master), Misdirection (Expert)</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> knife, pistol, stun gun, various tool kits and covert gear</p>",
